  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency humanitarian response in food assistance, WASH and protection for vulnerable host and displaced communities in the regions of Timbuktu, Sgou and Bandiagara- ehra.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This award will provide $2,350,000. 00 in financial support to ceci for a program entitled emergency humanitarian response in food assistance, WASH and protection for vulnerable host and displaced communities in the regions of timbuktu, sgou and bandiagara- ehra. the program will provide food assistance, shelter, water, sanitation and hygiene, and protection assistance to 123,600 participants affected by conflict and displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
